1	line	Player	Hi, I've been down into the rift and I found a strange room. I also heard a voice claiming to be called Tolna.
1	line	Launa	My son! What did he say?
1	line	Player	He said, 'Why should I, Tolna, be trapped in such a wretched place? Feel my ANGER!'.
1	line	Launa	Who can be surprised at his frustration?
1	line	Player	It's a very aggressive room. I think I need to defeat the monsters in there.
1	line	Launa	Don't waste any time, his life could depend on you.
1	action	end
